      "sublabel": "快照、变更及影响",
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "src/app.rs",
          "line": 8822,
          "end_line": 8873
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "调用方依据快照与报告编写声明式 Plan JSON，plan 校验并保存 ready Plan，不执行 Agent / Library 变更；用 plan --show 审阅完整操作、变更前状态及影响，再确认。"
    },
    {
      "id": "confirm",
      "lane": "flow",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "确认变更",
      "sublabel": "CLI 或 JSON 调用方",
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "src/app.rs",
          "line": 361,
          "end_line": 370
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "交互 CLI 先预览并要求输入 confirm；JSON 跳过提示，调用方必须事先取得用户明确确认。取消则不执行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "apply",
      "lane": "flow",
      "col": 4,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "Apply Plan",
      "sublabel": "检查漂移并执行",
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "src/app.rs",
          "line": 8876,
          "end_line": 8937
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "receipt",
      "lane": "flow",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "验证 Receipt",
      "sublabel": "检查状态与验证结果",
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "src/app.rs",
          "line": 8938,
          "end_line": 9008
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Apply 执行中验证并返回 Receipt；仅 status=applied 且 verification=passed 才算成功并重扫。有 Receipt 或 changed_paths 不代表验证成功，失败时查看 error 与恢复状态。"
    },
    {
      "id": "failure",
      "lane": "exception",
      "col": 4,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "失败与恢复",
      "sublabel": "回滚或需要恢复",
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "src/change.rs",
          "line": 759,
          "end_line": 803
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "执行或验证失败会尝试补偿：成功为 failed_rolled_back，失败为 recovery_required。最终日志或 SQLite 收尾失败时，文件可能已经改变，需检查恢复状态。"
    },
    {
      "id": "recover",
      "lane": "exception",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "检查并人工恢复",
      "sublabel": "lifecycle recovery",
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "src/app.rs",
          "line": 8999,
          "end_line": 9006
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "lifecycle recovery 只检查精确路径并保守导入孤立日志，不自动修复或判定成功；人工检查修复后再重扫、审阅并准备 Plan。recovery_required 阻止新 Plan 与 Apply。"
    },
    {
